.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-singleton-acquire 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-singleton\-acquire \- Take a task\*(Aqs lock for a pid, or refuse naming the process that holds it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten singleton acquire\fR [\fB\-\-recheck\-ms\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItask\fR> <\fIpid\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Take a task\*(Aqs lock for a pid, or refuse naming the process that holds it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-recheck\-ms\fR
Milliseconds between the two sightings a reclaim requires
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItask\fR>
The task\*(Aqs name, which is what the lock is keyed by
.TP
<\fIpid\fR>
The process the record is keyed by
